
(********************** Declaration ****************************)
(*  
GPS (from operator position at rear of machine facing target plate)
- X is positive moving forward
- Y is positive looking to the right
- Z is positive going up
- Yaw is positive going ccw looking down from above (ie machine turning to the left moving forward)
- Pitch - mast top forward is positive
- Roll - Mast top tilting left is positive

World frame (pNEZd)
- Left Hand Rule
- Positive x is toward positive Northing
- Positive y is toward positive Easting
- Positive z is up
- Positive yaw is CW looking down from above (compass dir)
- Positive roll is (doesn’t matter, we aren’t going to roll anything for this purpose, so choose convenient reference): top rolling toward West
- Positive pitch is toward South (must flip sign to use LHR rotation)

*)

FUNCTION ROT_GPS_TO_pNEZd_FRAME : Vector3D
VAR_INPUT
END_VAR
VAR
END_VAR

